      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$I+A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\-1&1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\det=2$，$(I+A)^{-1}=\\dfrac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}$",
            "$I-A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}$",
            "乘积：$\\dfrac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\dfrac12\\begin{pmatrix}0&-2\\\\2&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}$（旋转90度矩阵）"
          ]
        }
