            "逆矩阵 $=\\dfrac14\\begin{pmatrix}2&-2&0\\\\0&2&-2\\\\2&0&2\\end{pmatrix}=\\dfrac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\0&1&-1\\\\1&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$"
