      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$Q^T=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\-1&0&0\\\\0&-1&0\\end{pmatrix}$，计算 $Q^TQ$ 逐项得单位矩阵 $I$，验证成立",
            "$Q^2=Q\\cdot Q=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\-1&0&0\\\\0&-1&0\\end{pmatrix}$（将行循环平移）",
